{"parts":[{"function_response":{"name":"document_ingestion_agent","response":{"result":"```json\n{\n  \"artifact_e-8bfc92f8-10c7-4f9d-ad1e-d5d0f44fa1b8_1\": {\n    \"mime_type\": \"application/pdf\",\n    \"summary\": \"This document is a technical catalog for the POWER AIRE Series CQ2 Large Bore Compact Cylinders, focusing on the newly introduced ø180 and ø200 bore sizes. It provides detailed specifications, dimensions, and ordering information for both single rod (CQ2) and double rod (CQ2W) versions. The catalog includes comprehensive tables for standard strokes, weights, theoretical output, and mounting hardware. A significant portion is dedicated to compatible auto switches, including various reed and solid-state models, with their respective electrical specifications and wiring diagrams. The document also covers construction materials, part lists, replacement seal kits, and accessories like contact protection boxes.\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"The user's query regarding 'Contact Protection Boxes/CD-P11, CD-P12' is addressed on page 15.\",\n      \"These boxes are recommended for D-Z7 and D-Z8 type switches under specific conditions: when the load is inductive, wiring to the load exceeds 5 meters, or the load voltage is 100VAC.\",\n      \"CD-P11 is designed for 100VAC or 200VAC loads, while CD-P12 is for 24VDC loads, both serving to protect the switch contacts.\"\n    ],\n    \"characters\": 22952,\n    \"version\": null\n  }\n}\n```"}}}],"role":"user"}
