{"parts":[{"function_response":{"name":"file_qa_agent","response":{"result":"The Contact Protection Boxes, models CD-P11 and CD-P12, are peripheral devices for the MELSERVO-J5 Series (2023-mitsubishi-electric-factory-automation-systems.pdf, p. 55).\n\nTheir purpose is to protect the control power supply contact and the electromagnetic brake contact of the servo motor. The primary difference between the two models is the voltage they are designed for:\n*   **CD-P11**: For 100 V AC applications (2023-mitsubishi-electric-factory-automation-systems.pdf, p. 55).\n*   **CD-P12**: For 200 V AC applications (2023-mitsubishi-electric-factory-automation-systems.pdf, p. 55)."}}}],"role":"user"}
