{"parts":[{"function_response":{"name":"document_ingestion_agent","response":{"result":"```json\n{\n  \"artifact_e-2a0724eb-0d2c-45ac-8396-cda9f2d8af8f_1\": {\n    \"mime_type\": \"application/pdf\",\n    \"summary\": \"This document is a technical catalog for the Power Aire Large Bore Compact Cylinder, Series CQ2 (ø180, ø200). It covers specifications, ordering information, and dimensions for both single and double rod versions. The catalog details various configurations, including options with built-in auto switches. It also provides information on compatible auto switches, their specifications, and accessories.\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"Contact Protection Boxes CD-P11 and CD-P12 are designed for use with D-Z7 and D-Z8 type switches that lack internal contact protection.\",\n      \"A protection box is recommended when the operated load is inductive, the wiring length to the load is 5m or more, or the load voltage is 100VAC.\",\n      \"CD-P11 is for AC loads (100VAC/200VAC) with a max load current of 25mA/12.5mA respectively.\",\n      \"CD-P12 is for DC loads (24VDC) with a max load current of 50mA.\",\n      \"The catalog includes internal circuit diagrams and connection instructions for these protection boxes.\"\n    ],\n    \"characters\": 29855,\n    \"version\": null\n  }\n}\n```"}}}],"role":"user"}
