{"parts":[{"function_response":{"name":"file_qa_agent","response":{"result":"Contact Protection Boxes, models CD-P11 and CD-P12, are required to comply with ULC/ORD-C374 (ul_61800-5-1_20230221102506.pdf, pg. 155, Table A1.1). While this is a non-mandatory component, if it is provided, it must be Listed (ul_61800-5-1_20230221102506.pdf, pg. 155, Table A1.1)."}}}],"role":"user"}
